kish locale (`tr`).","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2720","line":23},{"title":"Fixed `eachMinuteOfInterval` not handling intervals less than a minute correctly.","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2603","line":25},{"title":"Fixed flow types for `closestTo` and `closestIndexTo`.","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2781","line":27},{"title":"Added Khmer locale (`km`).","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2713","line":31}],"class_name":"SmartBlock","last_embed":{"hash":"l5jrx2","at":1770841652056}},
