 Turkish locale (`tr`).","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2720","line":19},{"title":"Fixed `eachMinuteOfInterval` not handling intervals less than a minute correctly.","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2603","line":21},{"title":"Fixed flow types for `closestTo` and `closestIndexTo`.","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2781","line":23}],"class_name":"SmartBlock","last_embed":{"hash":"x4073m","at":1770841652129}},
