ithub.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2576","line":11},{"title":"#2469","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/issues/2469","line":13},{"title":"Made Norwegian `formatDuration` consistent with other locales by using numeric representation instead of written.","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2631","line":13},{"title":"Use the word \"sekunda\" instead of \"vteřina\" for second in the Czech locale.","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2577","line":15},{"title":"Made Flemish short date format corresponds to the Flemish government.","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2535","line":17},{"title":"#2555","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/issues/2555","line":21},{"title":"Added `roundingMethod` option to `differenceInHours`, `differenceInMinutes`, `differenceInQuarters`, `differenceInSeconds` and `differenceInWeeks` with `trunc` as the default method.","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2571","line":21},{"title":"Added new functions: `previousDay`, `previousMonday`, `previousTuesday`, `previousWednesday`, `previousThursday`, `previousFriday`, `previousSaturday` and `previousSunday`.","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/2522","line":23}],"class_name":"SmartBlock","last_embed":{"hash":"5qi2wn","at":1770841652372}},
