com/wmonk","line":3},{"title":"Fixed behavior of `addBusinessDays` when input date is a weekend day","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/1790","line":7},{"title":"Fixed `parseISO` not returning `Invalid Date` on incorrect string when there are spaces in it","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/1791","line":8},{"title":"Fixed `es` round-tripping dates with Wednesday","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/1792","line":9},{"title":"Fixed round-trip bug with `d`/`EEEE` ordering in tokens like `PPPPP`","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/1795","line":10},{"title":"Fixed issues with parsing values in Japanese","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/1807","line":11},{"title":"Fixed Hungarian breaking IE11","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/1842","line":12},{"title":"Fixed Spanish accents in Saturday and Wednesday","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/1872","line":13},{"title":"Improved the message of protected tokens error","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/1641","line":17},{"title":"Added Swiss-French `fr-CH` locale","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/1809","line":21},{"title":"Added Flemish `nl-BE` locale","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/1812","line":22},{"title":"Added Scottish Gaelic `gd` locale","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/1832","line":23},{"title":"Added New Zealand English `en-NZ` locale","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/1835","line":24},{"title":"Added `isMatch` function","target":"https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/1868","line":25}],"class_name":"SmartBlock","last_embed":{"hash":"1ddj2av","at":1770841654237}},
